comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T15:20:02.068Z",codex-agent,"Plan: reconcile 17 unprotected records against main 33a5a2f7ce34d889e66bd5d4cea1e458d5dbea3a. Open PR changed tracker files and text were checked through REST. Recent push events were combined with currently live branch refs and changed tracker files; deleted refs are not active contention. No source changes or full local release reruns; CI owns the complete release gate. Preserve all prior history bytes."
  "2026-10-23T15:30:00.097Z",codex-agent,"Reconciliation writes complete. Linked git diff --check passed. All delivery coordinates and evidence files were checked against main; owner decisions and incomplete acceptance were retained as open. Final changelog generation/check, pinned health, append-only history, lifecycle/privacy/scope checks and push verification follow before PR submission. Full npm/Bun release gates are delegated to CI. This audit item remains open pending orchestrator review/merge."
  "2026-10-23T15:31:27.525Z",codex-agent,"Final evidence correction: older Triplicate item receipts explicitly record successful isolated image builds and image removal, alongside merged PR 216 exact-head npm/Bun and browser acceptance. Corrected only this audit comment through the supported edit operation and closed pm-web-i0td as DELIVERED. Original JSONL records remain unchanged; final mainline evidence supports 7 delivered items and 10 stale-claim reopenings, with 1 protected item untouched."
  "2026-10-23T15:33:54.422Z",codex-agent,"Local tracker-only gate receipt: npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check both exit 0; npx pm health --json exits 0 in normal and isolated identities. Isolated health checks: 10 categories; advisory categories: none. Integrity and history drift pass. Linked git diff --check already passed. Original histories, expected lifecycles, protected records, public-safe added text and explicit tracker/changelog-only paths are independently asserted before commit. This comment is followed by final changelog regeneration/check and health. Complete npm/Bun release gates remain CI work; audit stays open pending review/merge."
